# API Base URL for the backend (Optional)
# In Development Mode (npm run dev): defaults to "/api" (proxied to http://localhost:8000)
# In Production Mode (npm run build): defaults to "https://kfu-schedular-api.onrender.com/api"
# Set VITE_API_BASE_URL only if overriding with a custom API endpoint (e.g. staging server)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://kfu-schedular-api.onrender.com/api
